<html lang='pt-br'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>
      Bem-vindo(a) à Dojo System!
    </title>
  </head>
  <body
    style='margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f7f9fa; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;'
  >
    <table
      width='100%'
      height='100%'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      border='0'
      style='background-color: #f7f9fa; padding: 40px 0;'
    >
      <tr>
        <td align='center'>
          <table
            width='600'
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
            border='0'
            style='background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;'
          >
            <!-- HEADER -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align='center'
                bgcolor='#d32f2f'
                style='height: 90px; border-top-left-radius: 16px; border-top-right-radius: 16px;'
              >
                <img
                  src='cid:dojo-logo'
                  alt='Logo da Dojo System'
                  style='margin-top: 18px; max-width: 160px;'
                />
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- CONTENT -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style='padding: 32px; text-align: left; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;'
              >
                <h1
                  style='font-size: 22px; font-weight: 200; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 32px 0;'
                >
                  Olá
                  <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>,
                </h1>

                <!-- Mensagem -->
                <table
                  width='100%'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  border='0'
                  style='margin-bottom: 32px;'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      style='font-size: 18px; color: #000000; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 200; padding-bottom: 24px;'
                    >
                      Seja muito bem-vindo(a) à
                      <strong>Dojo System</strong>!<br />
                      É um prazer ter você conosco em nossa equipe. 💪
                    </td>
                  </tr>

                  <tr>
                    <td
                      style='font-size: 18px; color: #000000; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 200;'
                    >
                      Esperamos que aproveite ao máximo nossas aulas e recursos.
                      Se precisar de qualquer ajuda, nossa equipe está à
                      disposição pelo e-mail
                      <span
                        style='font-weight: 500;'
                      >project.dojo.system@gmail.com</span>.
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Rodapé -->
                <table width='100%' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0'>
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      style='font-size: 18px; color: #000000; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 200;'
                    >
                      Atenciosamente,
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      style='font-size: 18px; color: #000000; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 500;'
                    >
                      Equipe Dojo System
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      style='font-size: 16px; color: #000000; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 200;'
                    >
                      dojo-system-aas.vercel.app
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>